Sajjad baya'n karte the badeeda e qoo'n bar mazloom phuphi jaan,<br>
Ghurbat me chuta apse mai bekaso nachaar mazloom phuphi jaan.<br>
<br>
Marne ke liye aayi thi kya ap mere saath pardes me haihaat,<br>
Baqi na buzurgou me raha ab koi zinhaar mazloom phuphi jaan.<br>
<br>
Tari hai ajab ranjo alam qalbe hazee'n par, sabr ayega kyu'nkar <br>
Kya jaake madine me.kahega ye dil afgaar mazloom phuphi jaan.<br>
<br>
Pardes me kis tarah mujhe chordke tanha wa hasrato darda,<br>
Abaad kiya apne firdous ka gulzaar mazloom phuphi jaan.<br>
<br>
Kis tarah karu zabt nahi zabt ka yara dil hai ta-o bala,<br>
Woh sozish e gham hai ke hai ankhe'n meri qoo'n baar mazloom phuphi jaan.<br>
<br>
Turbat ke sarhane se nahi uth'ti hai Fizza, sadma hai kuch aisa,<br>
Jaata hu Madine ko mai be moniso be yaar mazloom phuphi jaan.<br>
<br>
Fizza ne ada kardiya haq aj wafa ka, aye Saniye Zehra,<br>
Qabr apki hai aur hai yeh talibe deedar mazloom phuphi jaan.<br>
<br>
'Qudsi' yehi farma ke madine ko gaye Shah, ba halate jaa'n ka,<br>
Insan ka har haal me Qaliq hai madadgar mazloom phuphi jaan...